  "bio": "Felix Graph, based in Düsseldorf, Germany, is a tattoo artist renowned for his finesse in dotwork, black & gray, and fineline styles. His commitment to professionalism is reflected in the immaculate cleanliness maintained at Dead Parrot Studio, ensuring not just exceptional artistry but also a safe and hygienic environment for all his clients. Felix is dedicated to the highest standards of his craft, as evidenced by his emphasis on proper aftercare and protecting tattoos from sun exposure.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Dusseldorf, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany"
